From a0890b44cfef071dbb1c7bad22ddadb577625cd5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:52:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: weak spots quiz scope and flashcard deck; version 1.8

Weak spots are the sovereign countries reviewed at least once and still below
75 mastery, weakest first. The quiz gets a "Weak spots" scope chip (second in the
row, locked with an explanation under four countries) that asks about the
weakest ten with answers from the whole world; the blitz cycles through all of
them. Flashcards get a "Weak spots deck" button that snapshots the list so
grading does not reorder the deck, and a notice with "Show all".

Also: the Stats screen shares the mastery threshold, README feature list and
build notes are brought up to date, versionName 1.8.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01W1k2QnbmNmY8jdQT8nphjW
